==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 6~10 seconds<sup>180f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 10~26.67 seconds<sup>300f~800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 10~26.67 seconds<sup>300f~800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Start the battle by deploying a [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Tank Cat]] to stall the enemies. Upgrade the [[Worker Cat]], and when Those Guys appear, use your [[Axe Cat (Normal Cat)|Axe Cat]]. Spam [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Cats]] for extra support.

