==Trivia==
*In the [[Nyanko Daisensou|Japanese version]], this stage takes place in '''Ōita Prefecture'''. In the Taiwanese version, stage 6 is set in '''Korea''' and the Philippines does not appear as a playable stage.
*This country doesn't appear on the ending screen of [[Empire of Cats]], although it does appear in the ending screen of [[Into the Future]]. However, it is more faded than the other countries.
*The Philippines is one of the two locations from the English version of Empire of Cats not to appear in the Taiwanese version, the other being [[Cambodia (Empire of Cats)|Cambodia]]; this is due to the additions of [[Korea (Empire of Cats)|Taiwan]] and [[Mongolia (Empire of Cats)|Hong Kong]], which required two locations to be taken out.
*Ōita Prefecture's base is a bottle of [[wikipedia:ja:大分麦焼酎|Ōita Mugijōchū]], a ''mugi'' (barley) [[wikipedia:Shōchū|''shōchū'']] brand.
*Prior to [[Version 11.7 Update|version 11.7]], there were 8 extra [[Those Guys]] which spawned after bringing the enemy base down to 50% HP, with a delay of 1-4 seconds between each of Those Guys.
*Prior to [[Version 15.5 Update|version 15.5]]. [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Gross Cat]] and [[Ninja Cat (Special Cat)|Ninja Cat]] would be unlocked here.

